and design means this is rarely a problem.

00:10:49.796 --> 00:10:54.654
The movement of aircraft through clouds
can even cause lightning strikes. Here we

00:10:54.654 --> 00:10:59.513
discuss the available detection techniques
for, and observations of, planetary

00:10:59.513 --> 00:11:04.371
