sometimes observed after normal lightning.

00:11:14.088 --> 00:11:18.910
In a ball lightning event, a relativistic
electron bunch can be produced by the

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:23.733
stepped leader of lightning and coherently
emit high-power microwave when striking

00:11:23.733 --> 00:11:28.555
the ground. The theory can explain
observed properties of ball lightning and

00:11:28.555 --> 00:11:33.378
should be useful to lightning protection
and aviation safety. (arXiv, 2014-11-18).

